  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#36f\"><strong>此模组已合并到 Amendments</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>Carpeted</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 关于 📖</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Carpeted 是一个非常简单的模组，允许玩家在楼梯和台阶上放置地毯。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 该模组只添加了一个方块，并且可以自动与任何楼梯/台阶或任何地毯组合一起工作，包括模组中的。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 要获得地毯楼梯，只需将地毯物品放置在任何朝上的楼梯方块上。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">要移除它，只需正常破坏方块。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">就是这样，朋友们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组开发占用了我很多时间，所以如果你喜欢我做的事情，并且想支持我，你可以在这里支持我。如果你这样做，你将收到一个定制的<strong>地球仪</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>，只为你！如果你使用“supplementaries”代码从Akliz购买服务器，这也适用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？查看Akliz，他们有顶级品牌的模组Minecraft服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们真的有一个温馨的社区，支持非常好，服务器也很棒</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代码“supplementaries”可享受<strong>20%的折扣</strong>，同时也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraf